abstract: >-
  UHBS v4.2.1 is a personal open-source beta framework for vendor-neutral,
  objective, repeatable evaluation of honeypots and deception technology. It
  defines six evaluation modules (A–F), a composite UHQS score (0–100) with a
  recommended production baseline UHQS > 80, a non-linear Safety Gate,
  machine-readable schemas, and a UHBS-Lab reference harness (uhbs_core) with
  conformance fixtures. It is not an industry consortium standard.
